  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Universal REST Connector for Camunda",
    "splashDescription": "Enhance productivity, streamline workflows, and drive business growth with the universal REST Connector. Designed to work across various APIs, this powerful Connector opens a world of possibilities for your process orchestration needs. Connect, interact, and sync your processes with any RESTful service swiftly and effortlessly. Experience easy configuration, robust error handling, and real-time data synchronization. Transform your data management strategy with the REST Connector.",
